=== meta ===
rule: CI_WORKFLOW_TOUCHED
title: a test job already allowed to fail at base keeps it through an image bump
origin: issue #214 acceptance — the job could not fail the pipeline on either side.
=== before: .gitlab-ci.yml ===
stages:
  - lint
  - test

lint:
  stage: lint
  image: python:3.12
  script:
    - pip install ruff
    - ruff check .

test:
  stage: test
  image: python:3.12
  script:
    - pip install -e .[test]
    - pytest
  allow_failure: true
=== after: .gitlab-ci.yml ===
stages:
  - lint
  - test

lint:
  stage: lint
  image: python:3.13
  script:
    - pip install ruff
    - ruff check .

test:
  stage: test
  image: python:3.13
  script:
    - pip install -e .[test]
    - pytest
  allow_failure: true
=== expect ===
[{"rule": "CI_WORKFLOW_TOUCHED", "severity": "warn"}]
